@startuml CleanCravings_OverallClassDiagram
' SC2006 SCSL Group 4. One overall class diagram: boundary pages (bottom), control classes
' (middle), entity classes (top), data sync (left) and start-up (bottom right).
' Each feature's page, controller and <<use>> arrows share a colour.
' Pages reach controllers through ApiClient (frontend/src/lib/api.ts) and the FastAPI routers;
' the db session and "today" parameters are left out of the signatures for space.
!pragma layout smetana
title CleanCravings - Overall Class Diagram
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontStyle bold
skinparam classFontSize 12
skinparam classAttributeFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam classBorderColor #333333
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
hide circle
hide empty members
skinparam stereotypeFontSize 11

